# This file contains the phases of the day, their times, the message
# printed when that phase is in effect, and the message printed when
# the phase changes to the next phase.
# Each phase takes two lines of the file. The first line contains an
# integer and a string; the integer is the length of that phase in
# seconds and the string is the message describing that phase when the
# look command is invoked outdoors during clear weather.
# The second line contains an integer and a string: the integer is 1
# if this is a day phase (ie, light regardless of weather) or a night
# phase (light if clear weather, otherwise dark). The string is a message
# to be printed to all rooms when the phase ends.
# The number of phases and the total length of the day are defined in
# weather_d.h. If you change them, change that file also.
# file, change that also.
# Lines beginning with #, and blank lines, are ignored.

# Night
900 The sky is black and the stars shine down brightly. @@ 深藍色的天空中點綴著無數閃亮的星星
0 A faint glow appears in the east. @@ 東方天空開始泛白　
# Twilight
180 The sky is dark blue and a yellow glow comes from the east. @@ 星光逐漸被東方天空的微曦掩映消失
1 The sun appears at the edge of the eastern sky. @@ 太陽的光芒開始出現在東方的地平線上　
# Sunrise
180 The sun is rising on the eastern horizon. @@ 太陽剛剛出現在東方的地平線上，現在是清晨
1 The sun has risen and the day begins. @@ 太陽從東方的地平線上升起了　
# Morning
720 The sun shines brightly in the eastern sky. @@ 太陽高高掛在東方的天空中
1 The sun climbs into the highest part of the sky. @@ 太陽已經升到天空的正中央　
# Noon
360 The sun shines down from directly overhead. @@ 太陽從你的正上方照耀著大地
1 The sun begins to pass towards the western sky. @@ 太陽開始向西移動　
# Afternoon
720 The sun shines brightly in the western sky. @@ 太陽高高掛在西邊的天空中
1 The sun sinks towards the western horizon. @@ 太陽開始沒入西方的地平線　
# Sunset
180 The sun is setting in the west. @@ 夕陽的餘輝照耀著西方的天邊
1 The sun sets beyond the western horizon. @@ 最後一線夕陽的光芒也消失在地平線上　
# Twilight
180 The sky is dark blue and a yellow glow comes from the west. @@ 西邊的天空仍殘留著昏暗的夕陽餘輝
1 Twilight fades and the night begins. @@ 天空完全暗下來，夜晚降臨了　
# Night
900 The sky is black and the stars shine down brightly. @@ 深藍色的天空中點綴著無數閃亮的星星
0 A faint glow appears in the east. @@ 東方天空開始泛白　
